  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa Joint Strategy on Just Energy Transition-SDGs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa is forging ahead on the pathway towards an inclusive, just and sustainable socioeconomic transformation driven by equitable and affordable access to clean energy and low carbon job-intensive economy growth. This joint programme is envisaged to have four interlinked and well-coordinated components in line with the UN Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework, as it relates to the Just Energy Transition in South Africa: i) leaving no one behind; ii) supporting the new energy mix;</narrative>
  </description>
